612	     * this check only applies the region rule: when the city belongs to a known region (Sydney-&gt;NSW,
613	     * Melbourne-&gt;VIC, Brisbane-&gt;QLD) the postcode must fall within that region's inclusive range (NSW 2000-2099,
614	     * VIC 3000-3099, QLD 4000-4099). A city with no known region accepts any 4-digit postcode.
615	     *
616	     * @param ownerFieldsDto the incoming owner payload
617	     * @throws InvalidPostcodeException if a supplied postcode is out of range for its city's region
618	     */
619	    private void validatePostcode(OwnerFieldsDto ownerFieldsDto) {
